o `ba242a9d…` verified through both gates (stated limit: no third independent reimplementation), 13.13 partial 9/11 and 13.12 unmeasured judged honest, README/LOGBOOK verified.\n- AC coverage 4 of 4 rows, each mapped to a named test and production call site (`Store.Recover`, `Store.Capture`).\n\nEvidence attached: `TASK-260830-17ootk_review-verdict-rev2.md` and `TASK-260830-17ootk_review-evidence-rev2.tar.gz`. Scratch copies removed.","reason":null}}
